      "cooked": "<p>When a <strong>Leave Application</strong> is submitted/approved for a student who belongs to a student group, the system automatically creates a <strong>Student Attendance</strong> record for that student on the leave date with status = <em>Leave</em>.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/a/8a0628e7672da5ad4d296b1e568a8b63b676be7d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8a0628e7672da5ad4d296b1e568a8b63b676be7d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a0628e7672da5ad4d296b1e568a8b63b676be7d_2_690x379.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jH15t0ySZ0ICHje8QL7VSX62iKx\" width=\"690\" height=\"379\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a0628e7672da5ad4d296b1e568a8b63b676be7d_2_690x379.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a0628e7672da5ad4d296b1e568a8b63b676be7d_2_1035x568.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/a/8a0628e7672da5ad4d296b1e568a8b63b676be7d_2_1380x758.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1638×900 67 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Later, when a teacher uses the <strong>Student Attendance Tool</strong> to mark attendance for the same Student Group and date.  [Checked = Present, Unchecked = Absent]</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/4/d4ba1627a7c2960cc1f1ad4d9f174eef007c5b06.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d4ba1627a7c2960cc1f1ad4d9f174eef007c5b06\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/4/d4ba1627a7c2960cc1f1ad4d9f174eef007c5b06_2_690x354.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ulRUyVXLDPANg02Nt3gzzMhbIma\" width=\"690\" height=\"354\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/4/d4ba1627a7c2960cc1f1ad4d9f174eef007c5b06_2_690x354.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/4/d4ba1627a7c2960cc1f1ad4d9f174eef007c5b06_2_1035x531.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/4/d4ba1627a7c2960cc1f1ad4d9f174eef007c5b06_2_1380x708.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"757575\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1757×902 51.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>For the student who already has Leave marked (from Leave Application), the tool throws a <strong>Duplicate Entry error</strong> and does not allow saving attendance.</p>\n<p>Because the Leave Application has already created a Student Attendance record for that date,<br>\nthe Attendance Tool tries to create another record for the same student + date with status=Absent (defaulting to Absent if unchecked), causing a duplicate entry error.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1be246522abf504730041ef15a58150f80198db4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1be246522abf504730041ef15a58150f80198db4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1be246522abf504730041ef15a58150f80198db4_2_690x354.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3YFGlqcdetgG7Q7laBVN57rpb7e\" width=\"690\" height=\"354\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1be246522abf504730041ef15a58150f80198db4_2_690x354.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1be246522abf504730041ef15a58150f80198db4_2_1035x531.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1be246522abf504730041ef15a58150f80198db4_2_1380x708.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"6B6B6B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1748×899 55.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Is there any configuration or customization available to handle this scenario properly like</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Automatically skip students who already have attendance marked?</li>\n<li>Update existing record instead of creating a new one?</li>\n</ol>",
